  "notes": "むせる is an ichidan verb meaning to choke or gag when something irritates the throat or goes down the wrong way.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦で→で：00502_de⟧むせる: to choke on ~\n- ⟦{煙|けむり}→煙：02705_kemuri⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧むせる: to choke on smoke\n- ⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧むせる: to choke on water\n- ⟦{唾|つば}→唾：09110_tsuba⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧むせる: to choke on saliva\n- ⟦{食|た}べ{物|もの}→食べ物：02890_tabemono⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧むせる: to choke on food\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦むせ{返|かえ}る→むせ返る：22142_musekaeru⟧: to choke up, be overwhelmed (also figurative)\n- ⟦{咳|せき}き{込|こ}む→咳き込む：10254_sekikomu⟧: to have a coughing fit\n- ⟦{喉|のど}→喉：00977_nodo⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{詰|つ}まる→詰まる：02079_tsumaru⟧: to get stuck in one's throat\n\nUSAGE:\nむせる describes a reflexive coughing/gagging reaction, not life-threatening choking. For serious choking, ⟦{窒息|ちっそく}→窒息：16495_chissoku⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ is used.",
